  m_text: "Welcome to the \u2018TreeD\u2019 VR Digital Measuring Tool! This virtual
    reality system is designed to help measure and analyse digital models of bonsai
    trees and other plants. \n\nCurrently, you are able to view a digital model of
    a bonsai tree, measure distances between points, view trees in different pots,
    and view the tree from different angles.\r\n"
